### B. Upload and Import Process

Create an Upload Excel File button.

Allow users to:

1. Select an Excel or CSV file.
2. Read and process the uploaded file.
3. Preview all records.
4. Validate mandatory fields.
5. Identify missing information.
6. Identify invalid date formats.
